OL,3,ASusan Smith denied parole again 32     
OL,4,Ayears after drowning her two sons      
OL,6,FA South Carolina woman who admitted to 
OL,7,Fdrowning her two sons 32 years ago has 
OL,8,Fbeen denied parole for a second time.  
OL,10,FSusan Smith, 55, was convicted of      
OL,11,Fkilling her boys by strapping them into
OL,12,Ftheir car seats and rolling her vehicle
OL,13,Finto a lake in 1994.                   
OL,15,F"I got to my lowest when I let that car
OL,16,Fgo into that lake," Smith said during a
OL,17,Fhearing on Thursday with the state     
OL,18,Fboard that decides whether to release  
OL,19,Fthose in prison on parole.             
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
