OL,3,ASusan Smith denied parole again 32     
OL,4,Ayears after drowning her two sons      
OL,6,FThe seven-member board later           
OL,7,Funanimously turned down her request to 
OL,8,Fbe freed. The father of the two boys   
OL,9,Fhas vowed to continue to oppose her    
OL,10,Frelease, and several people spoke      
OL,11,Fagainst her in the hearing.            
